# Outcome chain

- Before claiming product or strategy SoT, name three layers: Customer outcome (customer language), Product outcome (measurable human behaviour), Business outcome (organisation metric).
- Name both **value create** and **value capture**. A create-only chain hides capture defects.
- Link coefficients come from measured data. If data is missing, build a parametric chain and name the break-even — do not guess.

Gate: `assertOutcomeChain` in `src/lib/outcome-chain.ts`.
